# For builds whose context is the repository root -- the dev image. Nothing
# under these is read by that build; they are mounted at run time or
# regenerated. Sending them to the daemon cost 1.35 GB and ninety seconds
# before this file existed. (The runtime image builds from packages/arche-core
# and has its own.)
.git/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
data/_cache/
datasets/data/_cache/
data/synthetic/worlds/
docs-site/site/
node_modules/
# Local-only material that git already ignores. It must never reach an image
# layer: a dev image is published, and a published layer is forever.
data/confidential/
data/hf/
datasets/data/_cache/
*.duckdb
